<title>INDIA: India's Indian Hotels 1996/97 net up.</title>
<headline>India's Indian Hotels 1996/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		1,468.8  vs  1,405.7</p>
<p>    Net sales		 6,133.3  vs  5,473.6</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	     8.50 vs	7.50</p>
<p>    Interest costs	    455.5  vs    412.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation		271.8  vs    203.7</p>
<p>    Tax			   336.0  vs    390.0</p>
<p>Note: Indian Hotels Company Ltd is a part of the Tata group and runs the Taj Group of Hotels. A company statement said that the sales figure includes other income. It did give details.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
